<title>UK: CSFB leads $1.0 billion FRN due February 2008.</title>
<headline>CSFB leads $1.0 billion FRN due February 2008.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER  *ROSSINI BV</p>
<p> AMT	  $1.0 BLN  BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 FEB.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +45 BP    PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES     *SECURED, AMORTISING. ULTIMATELY SECURED ON A 1.7 BLN</p>
<p>		TRILLION LIRE LOAN TO SICILY.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
